        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 Zodiac Cycles is a single-player casual yet hardcore challenge game! You must fight all out to win and break the Cycle!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Human、Earth、Heaven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cycle has Human-Earth-Heaven 3 Tiers. Only by breaking tier by tier, can you shatter the Cycle. Each tier's breakthrough condition stated by its Zodiac Dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/38fe0d640591c12025a774a7bfd51950.avif?t=1755705649\" width=288 height=192 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zodiac Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Zodiac represents one game type, each game type has hidden meaning, and some types are false. All intricately linked to Cycle's secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rat: Seek</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ox: Stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiger: Choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbit: Escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon: Blessing(???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake: Q&amp;A(???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse: Race</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goat: Lie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey: Wisdom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cock: Rivalry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dog: Cooperation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pig: Random(???)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/22aa345490fcacdef6b1d9cb42b72f28.avif?t=1755705649\" width=576 height=192 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When historical clock rotates to corresponding Zodiac, Twelve-Hour strike Twelve-Zodiac, that Zodiac's challenge transforms at this moment! Not just numerical difficulty, even gameplay mutates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without full preparation or item assistance, you must think thrice before proceeding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Zodiac defeated in Special Time, you will gain substantial item rewards. And they will help you break Cycle more easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/dbb4d420777c50a31b9fc40776c65b15.apng?t=1755705649\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/dbb4d420777c50a31b9fc40776c65b15.poster.avif?t=1755705649\" class=\"bb_img\" width=576 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items for change rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item obtained in Human Tier is temporary, it will help you easily complete Human Tier challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth Tier's reward will turn Human Tier's temporary item permanent! Prevent you falling into next Cycle and causing item loss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven Tier rewards will help you clear SAN Value!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/7b4db69d6639ccc2418b97a51643d863.apng?t=1755705649\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/7b4db69d6639ccc2418b97a51643d863.poster.avif?t=1755705649\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=96 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover! You may gain Population, Stars, and Avoidance-Chance rewards!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/7c61933bce9453d491491bd44612be95.avif?t=1755705649\" width=384 height=96 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Failure is only temporary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must complete challenge shatter Cycle under set conditions. Once accident occurs, the Cycle will restart and most data will lost within Cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you may voluntarily enter next Cycle, and use permanent items acquisition mechanism which will help you ultimately break Cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven-Dragon says: 'The path is arduous and long. Abandon it! Cycle is blissful, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, do you choose escape or confront the challenge?</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 Zodiac Cycles is a single-player casual yet hardcore challenge game! You must fight all out to win and break the Cycle!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Human、Earth、Heaven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cycle has Human-Earth-Heaven 3 Tiers. Only by breaking tier by tier, can you shatter the Cycle. Each tier's breakthrough condition stated by its Zodiac Dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/38fe0d640591c12025a774a7bfd51950.avif?t=1755705649\" width=288 height=192 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zodiac Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Zodiac represents one game type, each game type has hidden meaning, and some types are false. All intricately linked to Cycle's secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rat: Seek</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ox: Stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiger: Choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbit: Escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon: Blessing(???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake: Q&amp;A(???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse: Race</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goat: Lie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey: Wisdom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cock: Rivalry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dog: Cooperation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pig: Random(???)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/22aa345490fcacdef6b1d9cb42b72f28.avif?t=1755705649\" width=576 height=192 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When historical clock rotates to corresponding Zodiac, Twelve-Hour strike Twelve-Zodiac, that Zodiac's challenge transforms at this moment! Not just numerical difficulty, even gameplay mutates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without full preparation or item assistance, you must think thrice before proceeding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Zodiac defeated in Special Time, you will gain substantial item rewards. And they will help you break Cycle more easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/dbb4d420777c50a31b9fc40776c65b15.apng?t=1755705649\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/dbb4d420777c50a31b9fc40776c65b15.poster.avif?t=1755705649\" class=\"bb_img\" width=576 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items for change rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item obtained in Human Tier is temporary, it will help you easily complete Human Tier challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth Tier's reward will turn Human Tier's temporary item permanent! Prevent you falling into next Cycle and causing item loss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven Tier rewards will help you clear SAN Value!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/7b4db69d6639ccc2418b97a51643d863.apng?t=1755705649\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/7b4db69d6639ccc2418b97a51643d863.poster.avif?t=1755705649\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=96 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover! You may gain Population, Stars, and Avoidance-Chance rewards!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911080/extras/7c61933bce9453d491491bd44612be95.avif?t=1755705649\" width=384 height=96 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Failure is only temporary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must complete challenge shatter Cycle under set conditions. Once accident occurs, the Cycle will restart and most data will lost within Cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you may voluntarily enter next Cycle, and use permanent items acquisition mechanism which will help you ultimately break Cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven-Dragon says: 'The path is arduous and long. Abandon it! Cycle is blissful, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, do you choose escape or confront the challenge?</strong></p>",
